@startuml
title Test #10: 失败时不弹栈

object "Before\nstate.stack (length=1)" as sb {
  [0] move entry
}

object "After\nstate.stack (length=1)" as sa {
  [0] move entry (unchanged)
}

sb ..> sa : executeMove(entry)\n  ✗ AddressError thrown\n  ↑ entry 原地保留

note right of sa
  **验证（两条都必）**
  rejects.toThrow() ✓
  stack.length 仍 === 1 ✓
  （拦的是"反正报错了顺手清栈"）
end note

@enduml
